6. Competing Products and Managed Services

Unless You have a separate commercial license from AnchorShell, You may not:

(a) offer, sell, license, distribute, or operate a Competing Relay Product; or

(b) offer or operate a Managed Relay Service for third parties.

For clarity, this Section does not prohibit a permitted Licensee from using
Relay internally as infrastructure for a materially different application,
website, service, or business, provided the third party is not being offered
Relay itself or a practical substitute for AnchorShell Relay as the primary
product.

